            {
              "_key": "c4l2k006",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c4l2k006s1",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Read it as a two-act play. In Act 1, pharma and IT surge above 100 while PSU banks and CPSEs sink well below it. Pharma's relative strength peaked at the end of September 2020 at 158.4, and IT's at the end of December 2021 at 173.4. In Act 2, the lines cross: PSU banks move above 100 by the end of 2022, and CPSEs climb to a peak of 178.2 at the end of June 2024.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_key": "c4l2k007",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "h2",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c4l2k007s1",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Act 1: The Pandemic Leaders (December 2019 to December 2021)",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
