            {
              "_key": "c4l2k022",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c4l2k022s1",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Leadership did not end all at once, and it did not end for everyone. CPSE relative strength had already peaked in June 2024, three months before the Nifty 50 set its record, and the index has since lagged. PSU banks kept outperforming on record profits, and defence stocks kept leading on the order pipeline. IT continued to lag, and FMCG has fallen sharply. Rotations fragment as they age.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_key": "c4l2k023",
              "_type": "comparison",
              "title": "Which Signals Came Early, Which Came Late",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "_key": "c4l2k023co1",
                  "label": "Early signals",
                  "points": [
                    "Relative strength of the old leaders flattening, then falling",
                    "Relative strength of the new leaders rising from depressed levels",
                    "Fundamental turns such as PSU banks returning to profit in FY21",
                    "Policy shifts: RBI hiking from May 2022, capex budgets rising",
                    "Valuation gaps between expensive winners and cheap laggards"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_key": "c4l2k023co2",
                  "label": "Late signals",
                  "points": [
                    "Record profits and record order books reported by the new leaders",
                    "Weak growth guidance from the old leaders",
                    "Media narratives about a \"PSU rally\" or \"IT slump\"",
                    "New thematic funds and indices launched around the new leaders",
                    "Retail investors piling into last year's best performing sector funds"
                  ]
                }
              ]
